            "content": "<text style=\"bold\">设 计 原 理</text>"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "PT9L红外体温计是一款快速测量体温的产品。具有简单易用、测量迅速、数据准确的特点。",
            "anchor": "OLE_LINK1"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "<text style=\"bold\">方案相关主要器件如下：</text>"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "MCU性能："
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "16K Flash，1K RAM；"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "一路SPI；"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "一路UART；"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "一路I2C；"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "8通道ADC；"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "28个GPIO；"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "CPU频率4MHz；"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "可满足PT9L的控制需要。"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "<text style=\"bold\">电源    </text>"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "2节AAA 七号电池 电池容量 3V  1000mAh"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "有低电压提示功能。"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "<text style=\"bold\">温度传感器</text>"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "利用红外测温原理采集人体温度信息，并转化成电信号。"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "<text style=\"bold\">LCD驱动</text>"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "由主控制芯片直接驱动LCD。"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "<text style=\"bold\">其他</text>"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "采用2个按键，用于进入测量、单位设置、测量模式设置等功能。"
        },
